graph TD
    A[Solid Rod] -->|consists of|> B[Two Cylinders]
    B -->|cylinder 1|> C[Radius: r1, Height: h1]
    B -->|cylinder 2|> D[Radius: r2, Height: h2]
    C -->|volume|> E[Volume = π * r1^2 * h1]
    D -->|volume|> F[Volume = π * r2^2 * h2]
    E -->|mass|> G[Mass = Volume * Density]
    F -->|mass|> G